{"shortDescription":"Benchmarks for high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) rallied on Friday, as market participants closely monitored the latest round of escalation in Middle Eastern geopolitical turmoil.Singapore's 380-cst HSFO cash differential increased consecutively through the week, rising back to its highest since March…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Benchmarks for high sulphur fuel oil (HSFO) rallied on Friday, as market participants closely monitored the latest round of escalation in Middle Eastern geopolitical turmoil."]},{"type":"p","children":["Singapore's 380-cst HSFO cash differential increased consecutively through the week, rising back to its highest since March, while prompt-month timespreads jumped day-on-day."]},{"type":"p","children":["Yemeni government sources said Houthis have reached the strategic island of Perim in the Bab el-Mandeb Strait on Friday. This raised fears of more disruption in shipments as key oil exporter Saudi Arabia has relied on the Red Sea route since the Iran conflict curtailed shipments out of the Strait of Hormuz."]},{"type":"p","children":["Very low sulphur fuel oil (VLSFO) also firmed on Friday, though gains were milder compared to HSFO."]},{"type":"p","children":["The hi-5, which reflects VLSFO's premium over the 380-cst HSFO price, slipped further to $139 a metric ton for the balance-month contract, LSEG data showed. (FO05-380SGMc0)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Cracks for both grades logged weekly gains. The VLSFO crack (LFO05SGBRTCMc1) closed at a premium near $20.50 a barrel on Friday, up about 10% week-on-week, while the 380-cst HSFO crack (FO380BRTCKMc1) climbed over 50% from last week to a discount of $2.35 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["INVENTORY DATA"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Singapore residual fuel stockpiles (STKRS-SIN) dipped 0.5% to 20.36 million barrels (3.21 million tons) in the week to September 9, based on Enterprise Singapore data."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Fujairah heavy fuel inventories (FUJHD04) gained 80.4% to 5.63 million barrels (0.9 million metric tons) in the week to September 7, according to latest FOIZ data published by S\u0026P Global Commodity Insights."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Fuel oil inventories in the Amsterdam-Rotterdam-Antwerp (ARA) hub (STK-FO-ARA) rose 3.6% to 872,000 tons in the week to September 10, according to Dutch consultancy Insights Global."]},{"type":"p","children":["OTHER NEWS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- Oil prices slipped on Friday but remained on track to end the week above $100 a barrel for the first time since mid-May and U.S. diesel prices hit a record high as attacks along key Middle East shipping routes stoked prolonged supply disruption fears."]},{"type":"p","children":["- Iran-aligned Houthis seized control of Yemen's port city of Mocha on Thursday and advanced down the Red Sea coast to strategic islands, military sources said, hours after President Donald Trump said he expected the Iran war to end after the U.S. midterm elections."]},{"type":"p","children":["- At least two Asian refiners have requested Saudi Aramco to change the pricing basis in their long-term crude contracts to ICE Brent from the Dubai benchmark, people familiar with the matter said."]},{"type":"p","children":["- The U.S. government announced new sanctions on Thursday against firms and individuals that it says are aiding Hezbollah and other Iranian proxies in the Middle East as it intensified its campaign to isolate Iran economically."]},{"type":"p","children":["WINDOW TRADES"]},{"type":"p","children":["- 180-cst HSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 380-cst HSFO: Five trades."]},{"type":"p","children":["- 0.5% VLSFO: No trade."]},{"type":"p","children":["ASSESSMENTS"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["FUEL OIL"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-